\subsection{Sequencing}

Given the [[args]] and their [[names]], the [[call_sequence]] function
invokes the provided callbacks in a specific sequence, passing along the
provided user data [[ptr]]. All invocations must succeed in order for
[[true]] to be returned.

==call_sequence*/
bool call_sequence(void *ptr, void **args, rsymbol_t **names, int nargs,
                   bool (*rest_fn)(void *, void *),
                   bool (*kwd_fn)(void *, rsymbol_t *, void *),
                   bool (*pos_fn)(void *, void *),
                   bool (*omit_fn)(void *))
{
